---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Wordmark Registration in India | BRNDNUR Advisory LLP";
const description = "Protect your brand name, business name, or slogan as a registered wordmark in India. Learn the advantages of wordmark filing over visual logo protection.";
const canonical = "https://brndnur.com/wordmark-registration/";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/wordmark-registration/"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Hero -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="bn-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <a href="/services/">Services</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="current">Wordmark Registration</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="eyebrow">Text-Only Trademark Protection</p>
        <h1>Wordmark Registration Support in India.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A wordmark registration protects the actual words, letters, and numbers of your brand name across any font, color, or graphic arrangement. It offers the broadest scope of commercial name protection available under Indian trademark law.</p>
        
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 7V4h16v3"/><path d="M9 20h6"/><path d="M12 4v16"/></svg>
            <span>Broadest Scope of Legal Defense</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m4.93 4.93 4.24 4.24"/><path d="m14.83 9.17 4.24-4.24"/><path d="m14.83 14.83 4.24 4.24"/><path d="m9.17 14.83-4.24 4.24"/></svg>
            <span>Valid Across Any Font or Color</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            <span>10-Year Renewable Protection</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 28px;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20want%20to%20register%20a%20wordmark." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Register a Wordmark &rarr;</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/logo-trademark-registration/">Compare with Logo Trademark</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Split Visual Section -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="split-row">
          <div class="split-photo">
            <img src="/assets/service-trademark.webp" alt="BRNDNUR Wordmark registration documentation and trademark filing" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="split-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">Strategic Asset</p>
            <h2>The Foundation of Brand Exclusivity</h2>
            <p>When you register a wordmark, your legal ownership covers the text itself. Whether your brand name is displayed on an e-commerce website header, embossed on physical merchandise, printed on invoices, or announced in broadcast audio, your trademark rights apply.</p>
            <p>Unlike logo registrations which restrict protection to a specific graphical arrangement, a wordmark allows your company to evolve its visual identity and design styles without relinquishing statutory ownership.</p>
            <div class="advisory-notice" style="margin-top: 16px;">
              <div class="advisory-notice-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="advisory-notice-content">
                <h4>Distinctiveness Rule (Section 9)</h4>
                <p>Wordmarks must be distinctive. Coined words (e.g. Kodak), arbitrary names (e.g. Apple for computers), or suggestive terms enjoy much higher registration success than descriptive words that simply describe product qualities.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3 Core Advantages with Clean SVGs -->
    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Strategic Value</p>
          <h2>Why Seasoned Enterprises Prioritize Wordmarks</h2>
          <p>Key legal and operational advantages that make wordmarks the preferred filing route.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Design Independence</h3>
            <p>You can redesign your company logo, update your website fonts, or alter packaging colors without invalidating your statutory trademark registration.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Stronger Legal Enforcement</h3>
            <p>Prevents competitors from using your brand name in any visual style, even if they use completely different typography, color schemes, or graphic badges.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Domain & Marketplace Defense</h3>
            <p>Establishes prior commercial ownership crucial for takedown notices on Amazon, Flipkart, social media handles, and domain dispute arbitration.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Wordmark vs Logo Comparison Table -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Comparison Matrix</p>
          <h2>Wordmark vs. Logo (Device Mark) Comparison</h2>
          <p>Understand how the two fundamental filing categories protect your business assets.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bn-table-wrap">
          <table class="bn-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Feature / Dimension</th>
                <th>Wordmark Registration</th>
                <th>Logo (Device Mark) Registration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Scope of Protection</strong></td>
                <td>Protects the exact textual letters, words, and numbers</td>
                <td>Protects specific visual composition, emblem, colors, and layout</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Font / Styling Freedom</strong></td>
                <td>Protected across any font, size, weight, or color</td>
                <td>Restricted strictly to the visual specimen submitted</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Rebranding Flexibility</strong></td>
                <td>Unaffected by website or packaging redesigns</td>
                <td>A major logo redesign requires filing a fresh application</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Online Marketplace Protection</strong></td>
                <td>Optimal for stopping competitor search keyword and product title abuse</td>
                <td>Optimal for stopping visual counterfeiting and packaging mimicry</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Recommended Practice</strong></td>
                <td>First and most essential filing for every business</td>
                <td>Ideal companion filing alongside the wordmark for complete safety</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">Get Started</p>
          <h2>Protect Your Brand Name Today.</h2>
          <p>Connect with our team in Manjeri, Kerala to prepare and file your wordmark application under the Trade Marks Act, 1999.</p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20register%20my%20wordmark." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Consult on WhatsApp &rarr;</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/packages/">View Packages & Pricing</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
